  "nameStory": "",
  "description": "Hidden Goldspeck Lichen (Candelariella aurella) is a small, bright yellow to orange crustose lichen belonging to the Candelariaceae family. It is commonly found throughout New England on various substrates including rocks, tree bark, and concrete surfaces.",
